  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nI\"m not sure which version it started happening, but now with the TrueNAS integration connected, the memory on my TrueNAS host is being fully consumed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI removed the integration and restarted the host and memory consumption was normal. After a while a reconnected the integration and memory consumption was maxed again.\n\n### Impact\n\nFully consuming memory of TrueNAS host.\n\n### Additional information\n\nTrueNAS 25.10.4 - Goldeye\n\n### Version\n\n1.69.2\n\n### Installation method\n\nDocker Compose\n\n### Browser\n\nChrome",
